validate/bistability.jl — individual-based test of the bistability of Xu and Shen (2026, bioRxiv preprint), criteria: bistability_criteria.md
cells run: 6 of 6 (Q-K1000-R2 (T = 2000), G-K1000-R2 (T = 500), Q-K1000-R1.5 (T = 2000), G-K1000-R1.5 (T = 500), Q-K3000-R2 (T = 1000), G-K3000-R2 (T = 500)); 30 replicates per state; wall time of the cells 66 min
cells dropped before the run for cost (criteria): Q-K3000-R1.5, G-K3000-R1.5

