  arm Q: violations 0 of 360 pairs along N₀, 0 of 360 along V₀ (0.0% in all): B2 PASS
  arm G: violations 0 of 360 pairs along N₀, 0 of 360 along V₀ (0.0% in all): B2 PASS
  arm Q (descriptive): mean change of survival from N₀ = 0.02K to 0.9K at fixed V₀ +0.019 (max +0.47); from V₀ = 0.1 to 1.0 V_eq at fixed N₀ +0.418
  arm G (descriptive): mean change of survival from N₀ = 0.02K to 0.9K at fixed V₀ +0.026 (max +0.50); from V₀ = 0.1 to 1.0 V_eq at fixed N₀ +0.277

6. B3 — the deterministic boundary against the majority outcome of each state (ties excluded), and a logistic regression of survival on the
   signed log distance d = ln(V₀/V_b) to the predicted boundary in V₀ (states where the prediction has a boundary inside (V_eq/1000, 3V_eq)).
   x50 = e^{d50}: the kernel's 50% point as a multiple of the predicted boundary variance (> 1: the extinction basin is larger than predicted).
  arm Q
